# ===========================================================================
# PasswordMS · 换行符规则
# 策略：**仓库与工作区统一用 LF**（Git for Windows 下最省心，永不产生
#       “整文件都在改”的假 diff，也不会每次 add 都刷一堆 CRLF 警告）。
# 依据：本项目的 .sh / .ps1 脚本已实测在 LF 下正常运行（见 docs/03b-verification.md）。
# ===========================================================================

# 文本文件统一 LF
* text=auto eol=lf

# --- ⚠️ Windows 批处理必须保持 CRLF ---
# cmd.exe 解析 .bat/.cmd 的多行块与 goto 标签时依赖 CRLF，转成 LF 会出诡异错误。
# 典型受影响文件：src-tauri/gen/android/gradlew.bat（Gradle wrapper，第三方生成，不能改）
*.bat   text eol=crlf
*.cmd   text eol=crlf

# --- 二进制：禁止任何换行符转换 ---
*.ico   binary
*.icns  binary
*.png   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.jpeg  binary
*.gif   binary
*.webp  binary
*.bmp   binary
*.ttf   binary
*.otf   binary
*.woff  binary
*.woff2 binary
*.pdf   binary
*.zip   binary
*.gz    binary
*.tar   binary
*.exe   binary
*.dll   binary
*.msi   binary
*.apk   binary
*.aab   binary
*.jar   binary
*.so    binary
*.dylib binary

# --- 锁文件：由工具生成，折叠到 diff 之外 ---
Cargo.lock         linguist-generated=true
package-lock.json  linguist-generated=true

# --- 文档不计入代码语言统计 ---
docs/**  linguist-documentation
*.md     linguist-documentation
